# Source: objects_basic.py

```python
# Basic object storage bucket definitions

from encoredev.storage.objects import Bucket

# Simple bucket with empty config
uploads = Bucket("uploads", {})

# Public bucket
public_assets = Bucket("public-assets", {
    "public": True,
})

# Versioned bucket
documents = Bucket("documents", {
    "versioned": True,
})

# Public and versioned bucket
media = Bucket("media", {
    "public": True,
    "versioned": True,
})
```

=== Parsed Buckets ===

Bucket: uploads
  public: false
  versioned: false

Bucket: public-assets
  public: true
  versioned: false

Bucket: documents
  public: false
  versioned: true

Bucket: media
  public: true
  versioned: true
